      <memberdef kind="function" id="classllvm_1_1_loop_versioning_1a65b5f9f4aa48ceb121d65679d8b1a689" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="yes" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void llvm::LoopVersioning::versionLoop</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>versionLoop</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::LoopVersioning::versionLoop</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Performs the CFG manipulation part of versioning the loop including the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_dominator_tree" kindref="compound">DominatorTree</ref> and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_loop_info" kindref="compound">LoopInfo</ref> updates. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The loop that was used to construct the class will be the &quot;versioned&quot; loop i.e. the loop that will receive control if all the memchecks pass.</para>
<para>This allows the loop transform pass to operate on the same loop regardless of whether versioning was necessary or not:</para>
<para>for each loop L: analyze L if versioning is necessary version L transform L </para>
        </detaileddescription>
